---
import { projectEnquiry, websiteReview } from "@config/navigation";
const principles = [
  {
    title: "Design judgement",
    text: "Years of client-facing visual work shape how problems are interpreted, discussed and turned into something clear.",
  },
  {
    title: "Technical discipline",
    text: "Computer Science study brings a stronger technical foundation to architecture, implementation and engineering decisions.",
  },
  {
    title: "Direct accountability",
    text: "The person discussing the project is also responsible for the design and technical decisions behind it.",
  },
  {
    title: "Practicality",
    text: "The result should suit the business and the people using it, rather than demonstrate how much technology can be added.",
  },
];
---

<div class="about-experience">
  <header class="orientation scene grid">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="framing">
      Teesside Digital is a solo technical consultancy built around direct
      access to the person designing and building the work.
    </p>
    <p class="location">
      Based in Hartlepool, working across Teesside and the North East.
    </p>
  </header>
  <section class="origin scene grid" aria-labelledby="origin-heading">
    <p class="date">2005-2007</p>
    <h2 id="origin-heading">
      Technology was part of the story before Teesside Digital existed.
    </h2>
    <p class="early-web">Dave worked with web development around 2005-2007.</p>
    <p class="departure short-rule">
      His career then moved away from software for a period, including
      construction, before eventually returning to technical work.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="craft scene" aria-labelledby="craft-heading">
    <div class="grid">
      <p class="date">2010-2021</p>
      <h2 id="craft-heading">
        For around eleven years, the work was visual, client-facing and precise.
      </h2>
      <div class="craft-story prose">
        <p>
          Dave worked professionally as a tattoo artist and studio owner from
          roughly 2010 to 2021.
        </p>
        <p>
          The work meant listening carefully, understanding what someone was
          actually trying to achieve, making judgement calls and executing them
          precisely. It also meant being directly accountable for a finished
          result another person had to live with.
        </p>
        <p>
          Running a studio added the other side of that responsibility: dealing
          with clients directly, managing expectations and standing behind the
          work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="craft-fragments grid">
      <p class="short-rule">
        Understanding what someone is actually trying to achieve.
      </p>
      <p class="short-rule">
        Precision and accountability matter when the result is permanent.
      </p>
      <p class="short-rule">
        Running a client-facing business meant direct communication and real
        responsibility.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="study scene grid" aria-labelledby="study-heading">
    <p class="date">2022-present</p>
    <h2 id="study-heading">
      From 2022, Dave returned formally to technical work through Computer
      Science study.
    </h2>
    <div class="study-story prose">
      <p>
        Current study spans Computer Science, software and web development, AI
        and security principles.
      </p>
      <p>
        That study adds a stronger technical foundation to the same way of
        working: understand the problem, make considered decisions and build
        something that remains understandable afterwards.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="technical-cues">
      <li>software / web development</li>
      <li>AI</li>
      <li>security principles</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
  <section class="synthesis scene" aria-labelledby="synthesis-heading">
    <div class="grid">
      <h2 id="synthesis-heading">
        The career path was not linear.<br />The working principles are.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="principles grid">
      {
        principles.map((principle) => (
          <div class="principle short-rule">
            <>
              <h3>{principle.title}</h3>
              <p>{principle.text}</p>
            </>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>
  <section
    class="relationship scene grid"
    aria-labelledby="relationship-heading"
  >
    <h2 id="relationship-heading">You work directly with Dave.</h2>
    <div class="relationship-explanation prose short-rule">
      <p>
        There is no account-manager layer between the conversation and the work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Context stays with the person designing and building the project, which
        means fewer handoffs and clearer accountability.
      </p>
      <p>
        Design and technical decisions stay connected from the first
        conversation through implementation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-conversion scene" aria-label="Start a conversation">
    <a class="conversion-primary" href={projectEnquiry.href}>
      <span>{projectEnquiry.label}</span>
      <span class="direction" aria-hidden="true"
        ><span></span><svg
          width="40"
          height="40"
          viewBox="0 0 32 32"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 16h25M19 6l10 10-10 10"></path></svg
        ></span
      >
    </a>
    <a class="conversion-secondary" href={websiteReview.href}>
      <span>{websiteReview.label}</span>
      <svg
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="24"
        height="24"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 12h18m-7-7 7 7-7 7"></path></svg
      >
    </a>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .about-experience {
    container: about / inline-size;
    max-inline-size: 100rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    color: rgb(var(--color-text));
  }
  .scene {
    margin-inline: 1.5rem;
    padding-block: 4rem 5rem;
  }
  .scene + .scene {
    border-block-start: var(--rule-width) solid rgb(var(--color-rule));
  }
  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  p,
  ul {
    margin: 0;
  }
  h1,
  h2,
  h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 12cqi, 3.625rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 10.3cqi, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  p,
  li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  .grid > * {
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  .prose p + p {
    margin-block-start: 1.25rem;
  }
  .orientation {
    padding-block-start: 3.5rem;
  }
  .framing {
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    max-inline-size: 35ch;
  }
  .location {
    margin-block-start: 3rem;
    border-block-start: var(--rule-width) solid rgb(var(--color-rule));
    padding-block-start: 1rem;
  }
  .date {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    margin-block-end: 1.5rem;
  }
  .date::after {
    content: "";
    inline-size: 3.5rem;
    border-block-start: var(--rule-width) solid rgb(var(--color-rule));
  }
  .early-web {
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
    max-inline-size: 32ch;
  }
  .short-rule::before {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    inline-size: var(--fragment-rule, 4rem);
    max-inline-size: 100%;
    border-block-start: var(--rule-width) solid rgb(var(--color-rule));
    margin-block-end: 0.875rem;
  }
  .departure {
    margin-block-start: 5rem;
    margin-inline-start: 25%;
  }
  .craft-story {
    margin-block-start: 2rem;
  }
  .craft-fragments {
    margin-block-start: 3.5rem;
  }
  .craft-fragments p:nth-child(1) {
    margin-inline: 10% 8%;
  }
  .craft-fragments p:nth-child(2) {
    margin-inline-start: 28%;
    margin-block-start: 3rem;
    --fragment-rule: 3rem;
  }
  .craft-fragments p:nth-child(3) {
    margin-inline: 10% 5%;
    margin-block-start: 4rem;
    --fragment-rule: 5rem;
  }
  .study h2 {
    margin-inline-start: 5%;
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 8cqi, 2.25rem);
  }
  .study-story {
    margin-inline-start: 5%;
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
  }
  .technical-cues {
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    margin-block-start: 3rem;
    margin-inline-start: 24%;
  }
  .technical-cues li {
    border-block-start: var(--rule-width) solid rgb(var(--color-rule));
    padding-block-start: 0.75rem;
  }
  .technical-cues li + li {
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
  }
  .technical-cues li:nth-child(2) {
    margin-inline-start: 12%;
  }
  .technical-cues li:nth-child(3) {
    margin-inline-start: 5%;
  }
  .synthesis h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.375rem, 10cqi, 2.75rem);
  }
  .principles {
    margin-block-start: 3rem;
  }
  .principle p {
    margin-block-start: 0.5rem;
  }
  .principle:nth-child(1) {
    margin-inline-start: 13%;
  }
  .principle:nth-child(2) {
    margin-inline-end: 9%;
    margin-block-start: 3rem;
    --fragment-rule: 5rem;
  }
  .principle:nth-child(3) {
    margin-inline-start: 19%;
    margin-block-start: 3.75rem;
    --fragment-rule: 3rem;
  }
  .principle:nth-child(4) {
    margin-inline-start: 8%;
    margin-block-start: 2.75rem;
    --fragment-rule: 4.5rem;
  }
  .relationship {
    padding-block: 4.5rem 6rem;
  }
  /* Separate rows keep the explanation below the statement, including at text zoom. */
  .relationship-explanation {
    margin-block-start: 6rem;
    margin-inline-start: 22%;
  }
  .about-conversion {
    padding-block: 3rem 4rem;
  }
  a {
    color: rgb(var(--color-action));
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a:is(:hover, :focus-visible) {
    color: rgb(var(--color-action-hover));
  }
  .conversion-primary {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.8cqi, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .conversion-primary > span:first-child {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    min-inline-size: 0;
  }
  .direction {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex: 1 1 7rem;
    min-block-size: 2.75rem;
  }
  .direction > span {
    flex: 1;
    border-block-start: var(--rule-width) solid currentColor;
  }
  svg {
    flex: none;
  }
  .conversion-secondary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    inline-size: fit-content;
    max-inline-size: 100%;
    min-block-size: 2.75rem;
    margin-block-start: 1rem;
    border-block-end: var(--rule-width) solid rgb(var(--color-rule));
    color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
  }
  .conversion-secondary > span {
    min-inline-size: 0;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  @container about (min-width: 48rem) {
    .scene {
      margin-inline: 3rem;
      padding-block: 6rem 7rem;
    }
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
      column-gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    p,
    li {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(5.5rem, 9cqi, 6.5rem);
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 6cqi, 4.75rem);
    }
    .orientation {
      padding-block: 5rem;
    }
    .orientation h1 {
      grid-column: 1 / 6;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
    .framing {
      grid-column: 7 / 12;
      grid-row: 1;
      margin-block-start: 4.5rem;
      font-size: 1.375rem;
    }
    .location {
      grid-column: 1 / 8;
      grid-row: 2;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-block-start: 5rem;
    }
    .origin .date {
      grid-column: 9 / 12;
      grid-row: 1;
      align-self: end;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .origin h2 {
      grid-column: 1 / 8;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
    .early-web {
      grid-column: 2 / 7;
      grid-row: 2;
      margin-block-start: 2rem;
    }
    .departure {
      grid-column: 7 / 12;
      grid-row: 3;
      margin-inline: 0;
      margin-block-start: 6rem;
    }
    .craft .date {
      grid-column: 2 / 9;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
    .craft h2 {
      grid-column: 2 / 9;
      grid-row: 2;
    }
    .craft-story {
      grid-column: 3 / 8;
      grid-row: 3;
      margin-block-start: 2.5rem;
    }
    .craft-fragments {
      margin-block-start: 4rem;
    }
    .craft-fragments p:nth-child(1) {
      grid-column: 9 / 13;
      grid-row: 1;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .craft-fragments p:nth-child(2) {
      grid-column: 6 / 10;
      grid-row: 2;
      margin: 3rem 0 0;
    }
    .craft-fragments p:nth-child(3) {
      grid-column: 9 / 13;
      grid-row: 3;
      margin: 3.5rem 0 0;
    }
    .study .date {
      grid-column: 4 / 11;
      grid-row: 1;
    }
    .study h2 {
      grid-column: 4 / 11;
      grid-row: 2;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.375rem, 4cqi, 3rem);
    }
    .study-story {
      grid-column: 5 / 10;
      grid-row: 3;
      margin: 2rem 0 0;
    }
    .technical-cues {
      grid-column: 7 / 12;
      grid-row: 4;
      margin: 4rem 0 0;
    }
    .technical-cues li:nth-child(2) {
      margin-inline-start: 20%;
    }
    .technical-cues li:nth-child(3) {
      margin-inline-start: 8%;
    }
    .synthesis h2 {
      grid-column: 1 / 8;
      font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 5.3cqi, 4rem);
    }
    .principles {
      margin-block-start: 4rem;
    }
    .principle:nth-child(1) {
      grid-column: 7 / 11;
      grid-row: 1;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .principle:nth-child(2) {
      grid-column: 3 / 7;
      grid-row: 2;
      margin: 3rem 0 0;
    }
    .principle:nth-child(3) {
      grid-column: 8 / 13;
      grid-row: 3;
      margin: 4rem 0 0;
    }
    .principle:nth-child(4) {
      grid-column: 5 / 10;
      grid-row: 4;
      margin: 3rem 0 0;
    }
    .relationship {
      padding-block: 7rem 9rem;
    }
    .relationship h2 {
      grid-column: 2 / 9;
      grid-row: 1;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 6.3cqi, 4.75rem);
    }
    .relationship-explanation {
      grid-column: 7 / 12;
      grid-row: 2;
      margin-inline: 0;
      margin-block-start: 9rem;
    }
    .about-conversion {
      padding-block: 4rem 5rem;
    }
  }
  @media (forced-colors: active) {
    a {
      color: LinkText;
    }
    .scene + .scene,
    .location,
    .date::after,
    .short-rule::before,
    .technical-cues li {
      border-color: CanvasText;
    }
    .conversion-secondary {
      border-color: LinkText;
    }
  }
</style>
